===Etymology===
''ig-'' (from ''[[ignorant]]'') + ''[[gnostic]]'' + ''-[[ism]]''. Coined by [[w:Rabbi Sherwin Wine|Rabbi Sherwin Wine]].

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# The philosophical position that existence of God is meaningless, because the term "god" has no coherent and unambiguous definition. It may also be described as the theological position that other theological positions assume too much about the concept of god. 

